{"3921510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Anomaly Manor", "steam_appid": 3921510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a mansion with a dark legend: Whoever enters disappears forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with your spectral camera, you decide to enter to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the indicated number of anomalies on each level and photograph them with your camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do this correctly, you'll advance one level; otherwise, you'll go back one level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to uncover the truth while avoiding the trapped souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.poster.avif?t=1771854977\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.webm?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.mp4?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Anomaly Manor is a single-player game in which you must investigate a mansion. Several random anomalies are hidden in each level. Your job is to find them and deactivate them with your spectral camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do it right, you'll not only uncover the story, you'll also be able to escape and discover the intense ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, because you're not alone. The trapped souls don't like visitors who disturb the peace of the Manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve the mystery in The Anomaly Manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/cb88080bed505d0404874fbe2f4be4e6.poster.avif?t=1771854977\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/cb88080bed505d0404874fbe2f4be4e6.webm?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/cb88080bed505d0404874fbe2f4be4e6.mp4?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 anomalies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass all 10 levels of the Manor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes up to 4 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock several game modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Normal Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The Black Lady Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Nightmare Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/4e711e3c655e7b9b0c995881529ff0af.poster.avif?t=1771854977\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/4e711e3c655e7b9b0c995881529ff0af.webm?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/4e711e3c655e7b9b0c995881529ff0af.mp4?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a mansion with a dark legend: Whoever enters disappears forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with your spectral camera, you decide to enter to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for the indicated number of anomalies on each level and photograph them with your camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do this correctly, you'll advance one level; otherwise, you'll go back one level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to uncover the truth while avoiding the trapped souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.poster.avif?t=1771854977\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.webm?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/a8674490652940e86687c283f98bc257.mp4?t=1771854977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Anomaly Manor is a single-player game in which you must investigate a mansion. Several random anomalies are hidden in each level. Your job is to find them and deactivate them with your spectral camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do it right, you'll not only uncover the story, you'll also be able to escape and discover the intense ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, because you're not alone. The trapped souls don't like visitors who disturb the peace of the Manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you solve the mystery in The Anomaly Manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921510/extras/cb88080bed505d0404874fbe2f4be4e6.poster.avif?t=1771854977\" w